{"id":"衛署藥製字第021063號","license":"衛署藥製字第021063號","name":"\"生達\" 易必寧膠囊（樂必寧）","english":"LOPEDIN CAPSULES \"STANDARD\"(LOPERAMIDE)","version":"2","date":"2026-08-10","ingredient":"每粒含：\nLoperamide HCl......................................................................2mg","strength":"每粒含: Loperamide HCl 2mg","category":"消系統","source_sha256":"add3a5e8d595776237ae7aa562457584999d3adc687b4aa090608a6f879089f7","sections":[{"id":"s1","parent":null,"no":"1","title":"性狀","level":"1","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s2","parent":"s1","no":"1.1","title":"有效成分及含量","level":"2","html":"<p>每粒含：</p><p>Loperamide HCl......................................................................2mg</p>","text":"每粒含：\nLoperamide HCl......................................................................2mg","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s3","parent":"s1","no":"1.2","title":"賦形劑","level":"2","html":"<p>Lactose Dried、Magnesium Stearate、Gelatin、Sodium Lauryl Sulfate、Purified Water、Brilliant Blue FCF、Titanium Dioxide、Tartrazine、New Coccin</p>","text":"Lactose Dried、Magnesium Stearate、Gelatin、Sodium Lauryl Sulfate、Purified Water、Brilliant Blue FCF、Titanium Dioxide、Tartrazine、New Coccin","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s4","parent":"s1","no":"1.3","title":"劑型","level":"2","html":"<p>膠囊劑</p>","text":"膠囊劑","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s5","parent":"s1","no":"1.4","title":"藥品外觀","level":"2","html":"<p>為綠色與灰色之4號膠囊</p>","text":"為綠色與灰色之4號膠囊","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s6","parent":null,"no":"2","title":"適應症","level":"1","html":"<p>急、慢性腹瀉</p>","text":"急、慢性腹瀉","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s7","parent":null,"no":"3","title":"用法及用量","level":"1","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s8","parent":"s7","no":"3.1","title":"用法用量","level":"2","html":"<p>一、急性腹瀉：</p><p>1.成人或5歲以上小孩</p><p>初劑量：成人2粒，5歲以上小孩1粒。</p><p>以後若排便鬆軟，服用1粒，每天不超過8粒。</p><p>2.小孩：每公斤體重0.08mg，每天2-3次。</p><p>當排便正常或便秘時，則劑量必須逐漸減少之。</p><p>二、慢性腹瀉：</p><p>可依個人病況調整劑量，使達到正常排便。</p><p>初劑量：</p><p>成人：每天2粒，5歲以上小孩每天1粒。</p><p>小孩：每天每公斤體重0.08mg。</p><p>當每天1~2次的排便堅硬時，則調整初劑量，改用維持劑量每天1~6粒，或每天每公斤0.08mg~0.4mg，若便秘發生時，劑量須顯著減少之。</p>","text":"一、急性腹瀉：\n1.成人或5歲以上小孩\n初劑量：成人2粒，5歲以上小孩1粒。\n以後若排便鬆軟，服用1粒，每天不超過8粒。\n2.小孩：每公斤體重0.08mg，每天2-3次。\n當排便正常或便秘時，則劑量必須逐漸減少之。\n二、慢性腹瀉：\n可依個人病況調整劑量，使達到正常排便。\n初劑量：\n成人：每天2粒，5歲以上小孩每天1粒。\n小孩：每天每公斤體重0.08mg。\n當每天1~2次的排便堅硬時，則調整初劑量，改用維持劑量每天1~6粒，或每天每公斤0.08mg~0.4mg，若便秘發生時，劑量須顯著減少之。","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s9","parent":"s7","no":"3.2","title":"調製方式","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s10","parent":"s7","no":"3.3","title":"特殊族群用法用量","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s11","parent":null,"no":"4","title":"禁忌","level":"1","html":"<p><strong>(依文獻記載)</strong></p><p><strong>如對於抑制腸蠕動為禁忌者，切勿使用本品。</strong></p>","text":"(依文獻記載)\n如對於抑制腸蠕動為禁忌者，切勿使用本品。","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s12","parent":null,"no":"5","title":"警語及注意事項","level":"1","html":"<p><strong>(依文獻記載)</strong></p>","text":"(依文獻記載)","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s13","parent":"s12","no":"5.1","title":"警語/注意事項","level":"2","html":"<p><strong>除了極少數患者發生口乾外，幾無其他副作用之報告，即使長期服用亦如此。</strong></p>","text":"除了極少數患者發生口乾外，幾無其他副作用之報告，即使長期服用亦如此。","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s14","parent":"s12","no":"5.2","title":"藥物濫用及依賴性","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s15","parent":"s12","no":"5.3","title":"操作機械能力","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s16","parent":"s12","no":"5.4","title":"實驗室檢測","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s17","parent":"s12","no":"5.5","title":"其他注意事項","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s18","parent":null,"no":"6","title":"特殊族群注意事項","level":"1","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s19",